# Every payload file's SHA-256 is recorded in SHA256SUMS.txt and re-verified on
# each push. Git must therefore never rewrite file bytes on checkout: a CRLF
# conversion on a Windows clone would change the hash of every text file and
# fail verification. Disable all text conversion, everywhere.
* -text

*.pdf binary
*.gz  binary

# Keep GitHub's language statistics meaningful: saved outputs and the preserved
# historical corpus are data, not hand-written source.
results/** linguist-generated
repro/legacy_dag/results/** linguist-generated
repro/legacy_dag/evidence/** linguist-generated
manuscript/** linguist-documentation
